        <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses operator[] on the inventory, so it works whether or not T was registered before. The generation is incremented with release semantics so threads that acquire it in <ref refid="classStore_1aaf81da54b109478891030b7e04653bad" kindref="member">cachedObject()</ref> see the new pointer and re-fetch from the <ref refid="classStore" kindref="compound">Store</ref>. (&quot;Invalidates&quot; means it makes every thread&apos;s saved pointer out of date.) <parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
